{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3008023010010","name":"にちか","text":"……トレーニングルーム空いてるって言ってたから\r\nまずはそこで声出しして──","trans":"……听说训练室空着\n那先在那里开开嗓子——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010030","name":"にちか","text":"その前に、なんか食べとこ","trans":"在那之前，先吃点东西吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010040","name":"にちか","text":"あれ……\r\nパン、入れたよな……","trans":"咦……\n面包，我应该放进去了啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010050","name":"にちか","text":"ま、いっか","trans":"嘛，算啦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010060","name":"霧子","text":"────…………\r\n────…………","trans":"————…………\n————…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010070","name":"にちか","text":"……あ","trans":"……啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010080","name":"霧子","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010090","name":"霧子","text":"おはよう……\r\nにちかちゃん……","trans":"早上好……\n日花……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010100","name":"にちか","text":"──おはようございます……","trans":"——早上好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010110","name":"にちか","text":"今日は、その……\r\nよろしくお願いします","trans":"今天，那个……\n请多关照","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010120","name":"霧子","text":"うん……\r\nよろしく……お願いします……","trans":"嗯……\n请多……关照……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010130","name":"霧子","text":"届けよう……\r\nにちかちゃんの音……わたしの音……","trans":"传递出去吧……\n日花的声音……我的声音……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010140","name":"にちか","text":"あ……えっと──\r\nはい……","trans":"啊……那个——\n好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010150","name":"にちか","text":"あの……\r\n声出しとか、する感じです？","trans":"那个……\n是要练发声之类的感觉吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010170","name":"霧子","text":"……\r\n一緒に……","trans":"……\n一起……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010180","name":"にちか","text":"え……\r\nあ、じゃあ……──","trans":"诶……\n啊，那……——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010220","name":"霧子","text":"……\r\nわたし……パン持ってて……","trans":"……\n我……带了面包来……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010240","name":"霧子","text":"よかったら……","trans":"可以的话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010250","name":"にちか","text":"あ、その……","trans":"啊，那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010260","name":"にちか","text":"流石にまるまる一個はもらえないので……","trans":"一整个还是不能收的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008023010270","name":"霧子","text":"じゃあ……\r\nわたしも……","trans":"那……\n我也……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}